    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/437a1059-d128-42da-9de2-2697e3cbe4e8-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_TendererQualificationRequest1_SpecificTendererRequirement1>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/437a1059-d128-42da-9de2-2697e3cbe4e8-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria1>;
  epo:usesTechnique <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/437a1059-d128-42da-9de2-2697e3cbe4e8-01/DynamicPurchaseSystemTechnicalUsage$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingProcess1>;
  dct:description """The contract is for a framework agreement with one tenderer for consultancy services within procurement consultancy services.

The procurement is for a framework agreement for procurement consultancy and assistance, and it is divided into the following service areas:

1. Operative procurement assistance: Assistance in all phases of a procurement process, from planning to signing the contract.
2. Legal assistance: Legal advice related to the procurement regulations.
3. Other procurement related assistance: Strategic consultancy, development work, project management and implementation of courses and training for Fjellinjen's employees.

In order to give a picture of typical assignments, Fjellinjen plans to hold call-offs on assistance with the procurement of a new case and archive system and a system for PaaS/SaaS in the near future."""@en;
  dct:title "Framework agreement for consultancy services within procurement consultancy services."@en;
  adms:identifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/437a1059-d128-42da-9de2-2697e3cbe4e8-01/Identifier/LOT-0001> .

